@startuml
actor Alice
actor Bob
participant Notary as "Non-Validating Notary"
actor Charlie

== Swap Confidential Identities ==
note right of Alice
Generates new confidential identity
Signed by Alice's well-known identity
Sent to Bob
end note

Alice -> Bob : SwapIdentitiesFlow
Bob -> Alice : Return Bob's conf. identity
note right of Bob
Each party learns the other’s conf. key
end note

== Transaction Assembly ==
Alice -> Notary : Submit input state hashes
note right of Notary
Sees only hashes
No identity mapping
end note
Notary --> Alice : OK

== IdentitySync ==
Alice -> Bob : IdentitySyncFlow
note right of Bob
Receives certificate path for Alice’s conf. key
Only if Alice possesses it
Charlie’s identity unknown unless synced
end note

Bob -> Charlie : Use input state from Alice
note right of Charlie
Sees Alice's conf. key
Does not know legal identity
Unless certificate is shared
 via IdentitySync
end note

@enduml
